  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "下班后的吐槽胜地  (The After-Work Venting Spot)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "stella": "斯戴拉",
    "qin_xiao": "秦箫"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "As the complaints about Chun Yuqiao grow louder around the lounge table, Stella suddenly wonders whether venting in front of DTS assistant Qin Xiao might hurt network ties. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "好歹你也是部门总监，别总是在这儿和稀泥行吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "星天经纪部一直没有起色。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "光杏子手里就握着不少艺人的关系。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "秦助理，我们今天说的话，不会影响跟台里的关系吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我就是一个刚毕业的学生。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "下班以后听大家聊天，对我很有帮助。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "其实如果星天没有各位的支持，也不会和台里合作得这么好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "秦助理，这家店就是我们的吐槽胜地。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "以后你慢慢就适应了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "你要是心里有什么不痛快的，下班之后一起来聊聊。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "好歹你也是部门总监，别总是在这儿和稀泥行吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are a department director at least; stop trying to smooth both sides over.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "星天经纪部一直没有起色。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingtian's talent-management unit has never gotten off the ground.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "光杏子手里就握着不少艺人的关系。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingzi alone holds plenty of artist contacts in her hands.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "秦助理，我们今天说的话，不会影响跟台里的关系吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Assistant Qin, what we said tonight will not hurt ties with the network, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我就是一个刚毕业的学生。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am simply a student fresh out of college.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "下班以后听大家聊天，对我很有帮助。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Listening to everyone chat after work is very helpful to me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "其实如果星天没有各位的支持，也不会和台里合作得这么好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In fact, without everyone's support, Xingtian would not work so well with the network.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "秦助理，这家店就是我们的吐槽胜地。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Assistant Qin, this lounge is our favourite spot to vent.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "以后你慢慢就适应了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You will get used to it before long.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "你要是心里有什么不痛快的，下班之后一起来聊聊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Whenever something bothers you, come chat with us after work.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "好歹你也是部门总监，别总是在这儿和稀泥行吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
