      "t": "你要是心里有什么不痛快的，下班之后一起来聊聊。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Qin Xiao's diplomatic poise puts the whole table at ease, earning her an open invitation to their after-hours circle. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
